invariant: INV-17
file: rsa_sign64.c
catches: rsa_sign_equiv_test
reason: rsa_sign64_sp1 returns without wiping m2, which crt_combine left
  holding the half of the signature modulo q, out of its domain. The
  signature less that half is a multiple of q. bin/rsa_sign_equiv_test
  copies the stack below one call and finds two words of that half there.

--- old
    ct_wipe(m1, sizeof m1);
    ct_wipe(m2, sizeof m2);
--- new
    ct_wipe(m1, sizeof m1);
